# MarketNow _redirects — Cloudflare Pages
# 
# CRITICAL: These redirects run BEFORE the Worker on pages.dev.
# If a URL matches, Pages returns 301 BEFORE the Worker runs.
# 
# RULE: NEVER redirect API routes or static files to marketnow.site
# The Worker handles ALL routes on marketnow.site. When the Worker
# needs static data, it fetches from pages.dev DIRECTLY (no redirect).
# Redirecting API routes back to marketnow.site creates infinite loops.
#
# Only redirect SSR pages that have Worker handlers AND need browser HTTP redirects.
# The Worker's built-in route handlers catch ALL incoming requests on marketnow.site.

# Worker SSR redirects (browser visits pages.dev → redirect to Worker → SSR HTML)
/submit                              https://marketnow.site/submit                             301
/submit/                             https://marketnow.site/submit                             301
/leaderboard                         https://marketnow.site/leaderboard                        301
/leaderboard/                        https://marketnow.site/leaderboard                        301
/arena                               https://marketnow.site/arena                              301
/arena/                              https://marketnow.site/arena                              301
/quests                              https://marketnow.site/quests                             301
/quests/                             https://marketnow.site/quests                             301
/legal                               https://marketnow.site/legal                             301
/legal/                              https://marketnow.site/legal                             301
/agent/*                             https://marketnow.site/agent/:splat                       301
/security                            https://marketnow.site/security                           301
/security/                           https://marketnow.site/security                           301

# Catch-all SPA fallback
/*                                   /index.html                                              200
